Spoiler:
























If you have a good weapon, try a marilith.  They aren't very strong, but
hits 6 times or so each turn.  If you are satiated, try a monster with 
a breath weapon.  A blast of disintegration (black dragon), sleep gas (orange
dragon), ..., will hit several demons if they are lined up, and may also
reflect from the walls so you can hit them that way.
